Zombie Swarm Pro - Game Modes

Main Menu

Players can select between two separate game modes:

1. Zombie Plague
2. Zombie Swarm

Zombie Plague

- Human vs Zombie gameplay
- Infection rounds
- Zombie classes
- Human classes
- XP and Level system
- Weapon shop
- VIP and Admin ranks

Zombie Swarm

- Human vs Zombie gameplay
- Jetpack
- Leap
- Flesh Throw
- Infection Knife
- Special Zombie classes
- Special Human classes
- XP and Level system
- Weapon shop

Play Options

Offline

- Play with Bots
- Adjustable bot difficulty
- Local player progression

Online

- Connect to compatible CS 1.6 servers
- Multiplayer gameplay
- Server-side XP and Level saving

Separate Data

Each mode must have its own:

- XP
- Levels
- Settings
- Shop configuration
- Player progression

Development Status

Game modes are planned separately and will be implemented in stages.
